Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, and software architect. Build a complete, functional web application called **AI-Powered Style Wardrobe**.

I want you to IMPLEMENT the project, not merely describe it, give me a tutorial, or produce mockups. Create the actual frontend, backend, database, AI integration, and setup instructions in the project workspace.

