- A Confirm and Save button.

The user must be able to correct mistakes before the wardrobe is updated.

Only save the selected and confirmed clothing items.

Handle AI failures gracefully. If extraction fails, let the user retry or add a clothing item manually.

Avoid creating duplicate records when a request is retried.

